      "text": "• requireAdmin() + addWatchImagesSchema (1–4 unique keys)\n• watch missing → delete the tmp files, fail\n• promoteImages(watchId, keys)  (_server/watch-tx.ts):\n   verifyUploadedImage: real size + magic bytes\n   moveObject → watches/<watchId>/<uuid>.<ext>\n   all or nothing: one bad file → every file removed",
      "originalText": "• requireAdmin() + addWatchImagesSchema (1–4 unique keys)\n• watch missing → delete the tmp files, fail\n• promoteImages(watchId, keys)  (_server/watch-tx.ts):\n   verifyUploadedImage: real size + magic bytes\n   moveObject → watches/<watchId>/<uuid>.<ext>\n   all or nothing: one bad file → every file removed",
