      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OPTIMISTIC useOptimistic(data.watches): 'active' + 'cover' changes,\n       dropped by React when the action and its refresh finish\nSTATE  uploads (tiles per watch) · pendingIds · imageBusyIds\nDERIVED watches = optimistic rows + upload tiles · brands = props\nRETURNS data, watches, brands, applyOptimistic, addUploads,\n        setUploadProgress, dropUploads, setPending, setImageBusy",
      "originalText": "OPTIMISTIC useOptimistic(data.watches): 'active' + 'cover' changes,\n       dropped by React when the action and its refresh finish\nSTATE  uploads (tiles per watch) · pendingIds · imageBusyIds\nDERIVED watches = optimistic rows + upload tiles · brands = props\nRETURNS data, watches, brands, applyOptimistic, addUploads,\n        setUploadProgress, dropUploads, setPending, setImageBusy",
