      "text": "OPTIMISTIC filters = useOptimistic(serverFilters) while loading\nSTATE  search (input text) · sentQ (last q this tab sent)\nTRANSITION navigating (useTransition)\nREFS   searchTimer (debounce timeout)\nUSES   useRouter().replace, usePathname, window.history.replaceState\nRETURNS filters, search, navigating, updateFilters, changeSearch,\n        clearFilters, goToPage",
      "originalText": "OPTIMISTIC filters = useOptimistic(serverFilters) while loading\nSTATE  search (input text) · sentQ (last q this tab sent)\nTRANSITION navigating (useTransition)\nREFS   searchTimer (debounce timeout)\nUSES   useRouter().replace, usePathname, window.history.replaceState\nRETURNS filters, search, navigating, updateFilters, changeSearch,\n        clearFilters, goToPage",
