      "text": "STATE  confirm { open, target }\nTRANSITION deleting: stays on until the refresh lands\nINPUT  run: DeleteRunners = one remove() per kind\n       (resolves with toast text, throws on failure)\nRETURNS open, target, deleting, ask, onOpenChange, confirmDelete",
