      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STATE  drawer { open, state: create | edit(watch), openId }\nACTION useActionState(saveWatch) → saveResult, saving\n       errors shown only when saveResult.openId = drawer.openId\nCALLS  createWatch · updateWatch (original fields) · setWatchActive\n       · deleteWatch\nRETURNS drawer, saving, serverError, openNew, openEdit, onOpenChange,\n        save, toggleLive (optimistic), remove (run.watch)",
      "originalText": "STATE  drawer { open, state: create | edit(watch), openId }\nACTION useActionState(saveWatch) → saveResult, saving\n       errors shown only when saveResult.openId = drawer.openId\nCALLS  createWatch · updateWatch (original fields) · setWatchActive\n       · deleteWatch\nRETURNS drawer, saving, serverError, openNew, openEdit, onOpenChange,\n        save, toggleLive (optimistic), remove (run.watch)",
