      "text": "STATE  fileInput (via callback ref) · uploadTarget\nREFS   none on purpose: the compiler lint forbids passing refs\n       out of a hook that is read during render\nCALLS  actions/watch-images.ts: createWatchImageUpload (via\n       uploadWatchImage) · addWatchImages · reorder · delete\nRETURNS setFileInput, pick, onFilesPicked, setCover (optimistic), deleteTarget,\n        remove (run.image)",
      "originalText": "STATE  fileInput (via callback ref) · uploadTarget\nREFS   none on purpose: the compiler lint forbids passing refs\n       out of a hook that is read during render\nCALLS  actions/watch-images.ts: createWatchImageUpload (via\n       uploadWatchImage) · addWatchImages · reorder · delete\nRETURNS setFileInput, pick, onFilesPicked, setCover (optimistic), deleteTarget,\n        remove (run.image)",
