      "text": "STATE  drawerOpen · dialog { open, state, openId } · freshId\nACTION useActionState(saveBrand) → saveResult, saving\nREFS   selectInWatchDrawer: callback from the watch drawer that\n       selects a newly created brand in its form\nCALLS  createBrandLogoUpload (via uploadBrandLogo) · createBrand\n       updateBrand · deleteBrand\nRETURNS drawerOpen, setDrawerOpen, dialog, saving, serverError, freshId,\n  openNew,\n        openEdit, onDialogOpenChange, save, remove (run.brand)",
      "originalText": "STATE  drawerOpen · dialog { open, state, openId } · freshId\nACTION useActionState(saveBrand) → saveResult, saving\nREFS   selectInWatchDrawer: callback from the watch drawer that\n       selects a newly created brand in its form\nCALLS  createBrandLogoUpload (via uploadBrandLogo) · createBrand\n       updateBrand · deleteBrand\nRETURNS drawerOpen, setDrawerOpen, dialog, saving, serverError, freshId,\n  openNew,\n        openEdit, onDialogOpenChange, save, remove (run.brand)",
